critical_rules.rule:
Status codes are contractual: 200 read, update, delete;
      201 create; 400 validation or malformed request; 404 unknown or bad id; 500
      storage or server fault.

principles.principle:
Ambiguity is resolved from
      @conflict_resolution, not by guessing and not by blocking on a question.
      Record the decision where a reviewer will find it.
